  <h2>What does Amazon require of the main image?</h2>

  <p>The main image carries the variant code MAIN. It's the picture shoppers see in search, and 11 of Amazon's 14 suppression reasons apply to it alone. Without a compliant one, Amazon may pull the listing from search until you fix it.</p>

