          <td>Show all of it; "Do not cut off any part of the product"</td>
          <td>Product image guide</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Shown once</th>
          <td>Front only, not front and back in one image</td>
          <td>Product image guide</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
